    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit too soft for the grant funders. i need to make it clear that managed conservation is actually detrimental to long-term biodiversity. can you rewrite it to emphasize that \"managed\" methods are basically just an attempt to control nature that ends up causing more harm than good in the long run?",
